// Title: Insecure Proxy/DOH Transfer Via Curl.EXE
// ID: 2c1486f5-02e8-4f86-9099-b97f2da4ed77
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-07-27
// Tags: attack.execution
// Description: Detects execution of "curl.exe" with the "insecure" flag over proxy or DOH.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((src.process.cmdline containsCIS "--doh-insecure" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS "--proxy-insecure")) AND ((src.process.image.path endswithCIS "\\curl.exe") OR (OriginalFileName = "curl.exe")))
